    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 06 · Daily follow-ups\nLeads with status **new** or **cancelled** who have not booked get up to three Claude-written follow-ups (after 2, 4 and 7 days), then move to **nurture_done**.\n\nSet a lead's status to **lost** or **unsubscribed** in the sheet to stop emails.\n\nActive clients with no check-in for `missedCheckinDays` are sent to the coach as one Telegram list.",
